text:
{
  "name": "苦力怕恐慌",
  "icon": "minecraft:gunpowder",
  "category": "adorablehamsterpets:shoulder_hamsters",
  "entry_color": "00AAAA",
  "sortnum": 2,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "adorablehamsterpets:dynamic_page",
      "header": "苦力怕恐慌",
      "header_color": "00AAAA",
      "text_color": "000000",
      "text": "驚慌失措的叫聲？這可能是<b>苦力怕</>跟上了你。不一定是附近，只是<red><b><i>“盯上”</>了你。$(br2)也許，你的倉鼠在擔心你會被崩飛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:empty",
      "draw_filler": false
    }
  ]
}

